	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Start any coding agent on a task in Herdr, on its own worktree if you like.

- **herd** followed by a task, a /skill or a PR link. Add +s to bring Herdr forward on the new tab, or +ns not to. ⌥↩ opens a form with every option.
- **Your hotkey** opens the same form, with any selected text as the task. Set it on the Hotkey object.
- **agents** lists running agents, the ones that need you first.
- **tell** messages an agent. ⌥↩ opens a message form.
- **tidy** removes worktrees whose PR is merged or closed.

Set your default agent, repo folders and Space in Configure Workflow.

Icon: [Sheep Icon Vectors by Vecteezy](https://www.vecteezy.com/free-vector/sheep-icon)</string>
